{"server":"jp","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_04_beg","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_04","title":"女将","storyCode":"WR-4","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"83df0da51ff11a920dc6359fa7bbcbbaceefad91f364d4ed5a5e77c9498031de","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"客僧のサガは驚くべき実力を見せた。それだけでなく、彼女は墨魎の言葉を理解できるようだった。ラヴァは困惑したが、それでもサガと共に戦場を片付けると、街角にひっそりと佇む寂れた質屋を訪れた。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"残っているやつはいないか？　早く先生のところまで逃げるんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"東へ向かえ、急げ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……空に意識を向けるようになって改めて実感したんだが、ここでは本当に西へ行くほど夜に近づいていくんだな……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"つまり、私たちは今「正午から黄昏へ向かっている」のですね？　なんとも風情があるなぁ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……だがやっぱりおかしい。「昼」から「夜」までの距離が短すぎるぞ。まだほとんど進んでないだろ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"絵巻の長さは一定ではないし、景色も奇怪なものばかりである。絵の中の住人がその中で規則性を見出したとしても、突き詰めれば虚構のものに過ぎぬゆえ、考えてもどうしようもないでござるよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"いや、でも――おい待て、今何て言った？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"へっ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"今、絵がどうとかって――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"うわあああ――！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"――！？　逃げ遅れた町民がいたのか！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"ここだ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"た、助けて！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"お任せあれ、拙僧が相手つかまつる！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"グオォ――！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"む……いつもながら、斬られた後で墨になるとは、奇怪千万。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"お坊様、なんとも素晴らしいお手並みで！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"ご油断召さるな、お嬢さん。早く東へ逃げるのだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"は、はい！　あなた方もお気を付けて！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……どうやらかなりの数の町民が逃げ遅れてるようだな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"おそらくあまりにも急な襲撃であったがゆえ、間に合わなかったのであろう――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"お父さん？　お母さん？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"あ、あそこに子供が！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"まずい――早くこちらへ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"間に合わない！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"うぅ……うわあぁん……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"うおっと、危機一髪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"ケガはないね？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"ううっ……ないけど……ううぅ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"さきほど……奴の喉を貫いたのは一体……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"クルースだ。さすが抜け目ないな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"か、彼女は今どこに？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"どうせ見つからないから探しても無駄だ。あいつがどこかで目を光らせてるってことだけ知ってればいいさ。まずは、町民が全員この夜の地から逃げ出せたかどうかを確認しよう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"ほう、以心伝心とはよく言ったものだ。勉強になったぞ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"うう……ぐすっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"こ、この子はどうするんですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……その子を連れてここを離れろ。安全な場所へ送り届けてくれ、できるか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"もちろん！　できますとも！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"ですが……恩人様を置いて離れるなど実に忍びない！　あなた方と共に正義のため命を投げ出すことが叶わぬとは、どんなに口惜しいことで――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"その子を煮傘さんのところへ届けて、もっかい戻ってくればいいだろうが。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"あはは……はぁ……分かりました。そうします、しましょうとも！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"お嬢ちゃん、お兄ちゃんと一緒に走れるかな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"う……うぅ……おじさん、お母さんがいないの……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"よし、じゃあお兄ちゃんが君のお母さんを探しに連れていってあげよう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"う……うん……ありがとうおじさん……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"……ゴホン。恩人様、では行ってまいります。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"講談師","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"先生、サガと三人の英雄だけで、あれらに太刀打ちできるんでしょうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"講談師","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"講談師","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"……問題なかろう。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"先生はどうしたんだ？　機嫌でも悪いのか？　昨日寝てないとか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"先生は優雅で温厚な方よ。そんな気分屋には見えないけど……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"うーむ、きっと私たちの事を心配して疲れてしまったんだろう。少し眠った方がいいと勧めてみよう。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"六根清浄！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ガァッ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"煩悩を斬り捨てん！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ガァッ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"油揚げ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ガ、ガァッ？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……やるじゃないか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"少々薙刀の心得があるゆえ……幼少より寺で育ち、知らず知らずに身に付いたのだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"その腕前で「少々」か……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"お気になさるな。拙僧がラヴァ殿の為に道を切り開こう！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガ……ガァッ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"化け物どもがオマエにビビってるぞ……というか、墨魎には知能があるのか？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガッ！　ガァ！　グァグァ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ほう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"どうして手を止める？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガッ！　ガガァ！　グァグァ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"ほう、ふむふむ、うん……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"おい！　奴らの言葉が分かるのか！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"少しばかりな……ご覧あれ、この墨魎にはもはや敵意はござらぬ。もし心から悔い改め、二度と町に侵入して騒がぬというのならば、放してやろうではないか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガァッ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……大丈夫なのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"問題ない。拙僧の目に狂いはござらん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"あたりが静かになったな……もう他に町民も残っていないだろう。さて、話を聞かせてもらおう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"話を聞かせてもらおうとな……ラヴァ殿、深刻な様子だが、拙僧は間違ったことをしでかしたのであろうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"いや、そういうことじゃない。だけどさっき言ってた……絵巻？　その話を聞きたい。オマエはどうやら、ここについてかなり詳しいようだが。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"うむ。拙僧はこの地を行脚して、ずいぶん経つゆえ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"この辺りに「行脚」するほどの場所なんてなさそうだけどな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"ううむ。一幅の絵巻の大きさに限りがあるのは、仕方のないことでござるよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"何の話だ……アタシたちは絵の中にいるとでも言うつもりか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"いかにも。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……どういう意味だ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ、拙僧ようやく得心し申した……そなたたちも拙僧と同じく、この山河へ誤って踏み入ってしまったのだな――？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"はっ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"当初、拙僧はただ勾呉の境界を通り抜けようとしたのだが、ふとした思いつきで、ある大家の子孫を訪ねてみることにしたのだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"通りかかった灰斉山の滝の麓は美しく、ほど近い場所に古ぼけた家があったので、そこで宿を拝借したのだ。そして眠りについて次に目を開けると、なんとここへ来ておったというわけだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"ちょ、ちょっと待ってくれ。どういうことだ？　オマエも「シー」を探しに来たのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"シー？　そのような名は、初耳であるが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"拙僧が探しておったのは、「一筆にて拙山起こさば、何処にて風流を語らん」との評判で有名な、炎国の画家だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"しかし、長い年月が経っておるゆえ、すでにその画家はこの世におらぬかもしれぬ。それゆえ旧居を訪ねてみたいと思ったのだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"つまり、オマエも勾呉の灰斉山へ行き、なぜかここへたどり着いた――そういうことなのか！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"左様。たしかに相違ござらぬ。しかしそなたはどうしてそのように興奮しておるのだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"オマエは、ここが絵巻の中だと言ったが――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"天地も人も皆、道理から外れておるゆえ……ラヴァ殿は気付いておらぬのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"それは分かっていた。だが、どうして絵なんだ……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"拙僧もはっきりとは説明ができぬが、この婆山町は、拙僧が今まで巡り歩いてきた……百余の絵巻の中の一つだ。少なくとも己自身がどこにいるかは、分かっておるつもりだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"だが……ここの住民たちは、本当に生きてるみたいだろ。それに茶はうまいし、果物も食べられる……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"これは何かのアーツの効果なのか？　だがもしこれがアーツだとしたら……一体どんな……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"それについては拙僧も、全く手がかりが掴めておらぬ。もし偶然、天地の真実を垣間見ることがなければ、拙僧も己がどこにおるのかに気づけなかっただろうな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"ここでは天災に悩まされることもなく、皆自分なりの規則に従い、それぞれの仕組みを作り暮らしておる。なんとも至妙なり……拙僧がここに留まっているのは、心の安らぎのためでもあるのだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"な……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"はは、混乱しておるようだな。まあ無理もなかろう。拙僧が初めて夕娥（シーウ）に会うた時も、そなたと同じような状況であった……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"待て……今誰に会ったと言った！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"拙僧が会うたのは――待て、あそこに灯火が……もしかして質屋の女将殿？　まだ避難していなかったのか、まずいぞ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"おい待て！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_pawnshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女将","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガウ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女将","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"……分かった分かった。そう興奮しないの。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女将","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"どうして町を脅かしに来たの？　彼女はなんて言ってた？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女将","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ……そう……やっぱりいつも通りなのね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"女将殿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女将","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"……行って。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"女将殿、無事か？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女将","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"私は大丈夫よ……そちらの方は？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"おお、こちらはラヴァ殿。噂の、外より参られた客人だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女将","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"これは、お目にかかれて光栄です。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"この方は質屋の女将で、「レイ」殿だ。黎明の「黎」と書く。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……奇妙な化け物たちに襲われてないのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レイ","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"いいえ、特に見ていません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"レイ殿、墨魎どもがまた戻ってくるやもしれぬ。こちらに隠れて、見張っていても良いだろうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レイ","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"……ええ、構わないわ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["ラヴァ"]},{"speakerId":"char_362_Saga","aliases":["サガ"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["ウユウ"]}]}
